00:03:05.127 --> 00:03:06.060
- [Gary] So you're focused.

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:07.310
- Just focused on Canada.

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:10.110
- And what kind of brings you here?

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:12.510
Obviously Tyler is a huge lacrosse fan,

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:14.910
